<refentryinfo>
<title>Kudari User's Manual</title>
<author>
<firstname>Marc</firstname><surname>Jose</surname>
<contrib>Wrote Kudari, which is free software under the MIT license.</contrib>
<email>marc@hahn-jose.de</email>
